# Blasmusik note (projectile): an eighth note - tilted oval head and stem
# m/d with a d flag, k outline, 1 px w glint on the head. Dark and angular on
# purpose: never gold and round (must not look like an Oblate).
# fly: the flag flutters (2 frames).
sprite = note
size   = 8x8
origin = 4,8
hitbox = 1,1,6,6
anim   = fly frames=2 ticks=8 loop
---
frame fly 0
...kkk..
...kmdk.
...kmkdk
...kmkk.
.kkkmk..
kwmmmk..
kmmmdk..
.kkkk...
frame fly 1
...kkkk.
...kmddk
...kmkk.
...kmk..
.kkkmk..
kwmmmk..
kmmmdk..
.kkkk...
